Jan "'''wayLander'''" Rahkonen {{born}} is a [[retired]] [[:Category:Finland|Finnish]]-[[:Category:Russia|Russian]] professional ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' and ''[[Counter-Strike: Source]]'' player. He briefly went inactive in June 2015 due to his mandatory military service in the Finnish army, but returned in October the same year. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-84676766_39179|title=Всеми нами любимый Ян "waylander" Рахконен покидает команду PiTER и отправляется на полугодовую службу в Финскую армию|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|author=[[PiTER]]|date=2015-06-29}}</ref> During his career in ''Counter-Strike'', he played for [[:Category:CIS Teams|CIS teams]] such as [[PiTER]], [[Gambit Gaming]], [[FlipSid3 Tactics]], [[Winstrike Team]] and [[pro100]] before retiring in 2021 to pursue a career in [[valorant:wayLander|''VALORANT'']].

